    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover over 100+ beautifully hand-drawn elements as you help your World evolve infinitely through time! And finally, maybe, you will know what came first - the chicken, or the egg?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Begin your adventure with a burst of resources! Uncover treasure chests brimming with essential elements to kickstart your evolutionary journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/abd07aec21e4c123f08a8706c0aa5181.poster.avif?t=1745422418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/abd07aec21e4c123f08a8706c0aa5181.webm?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/abd07aec21e4c123f08a8706c0aa5181.mp4?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Core of Creation: Combine simple elements to unlock surprising and satisfying new discoveries. Experiment, innovate, and watch your World transform!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/c9495fd3378cec0b5959cfe22378d0af.poster.avif?t=1745422418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/c9495fd3378cec0b5959cfe22378d0af.webm?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/c9495fd3378cec0b5959cfe22378d0af.mp4?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Even while you're away, your World continues to evolve. Witness the magic of idle progress as your resource collection multiplies and your creation expands. Watch your wealth soar into the millions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/6be2b8993b70aba17d54ec37436db30c.poster.avif?t=1745422418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/6be2b8993b70aba17d54ec37436db30c.webm?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/6be2b8993b70aba17d54ec37436db30c.mp4?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover a new element? The game showcases all the beautiful details of creation along the way! The most exciting part is that you'll be able to walk around the World you're evolving.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/aaeefb26dc7ac65189528ed16dc580f2.poster.avif?t=1745422418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/aaeefb26dc7ac65189528ed16dc580f2.webm?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/aaeefb26dc7ac65189528ed16dc580f2.mp4?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create, explore, and evolve - start your enchanting evolutionary adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/2e87aac523b63b1017b7e021d440a072.poster.avif?t=1745422418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/2e87aac523b63b1017b7e021d440a072.webm?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/2e87aac523b63b1017b7e021d440a072.mp4?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover over 100+ beautifully hand-drawn elements as you help your World evolve infinitely through time! And finally, maybe, you will know what came first - the chicken, or the egg?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Begin your adventure with a burst of resources! Uncover treasure chests brimming with essential elements to kickstart your evolutionary journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/abd07aec21e4c123f08a8706c0aa5181.poster.avif?t=1745422418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/abd07aec21e4c123f08a8706c0aa5181.webm?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/abd07aec21e4c123f08a8706c0aa5181.mp4?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Core of Creation: Combine simple elements to unlock surprising and satisfying new discoveries. Experiment, innovate, and watch your World transform!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/c9495fd3378cec0b5959cfe22378d0af.poster.avif?t=1745422418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/c9495fd3378cec0b5959cfe22378d0af.webm?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/c9495fd3378cec0b5959cfe22378d0af.mp4?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Even while you're away, your World continues to evolve. Witness the magic of idle progress as your resource collection multiplies and your creation expands. Watch your wealth soar into the millions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/6be2b8993b70aba17d54ec37436db30c.poster.avif?t=1745422418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/6be2b8993b70aba17d54ec37436db30c.webm?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/6be2b8993b70aba17d54ec37436db30c.mp4?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover a new element? The game showcases all the beautiful details of creation along the way! The most exciting part is that you'll be able to walk around the World you're evolving.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/aaeefb26dc7ac65189528ed16dc580f2.poster.avif?t=1745422418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/aaeefb26dc7ac65189528ed16dc580f2.webm?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/aaeefb26dc7ac65189528ed16dc580f2.mp4?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create, explore, and evolve - start your enchanting evolutionary adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/2e87aac523b63b1017b7e021d440a072.poster.avif?t=1745422418\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/2e87aac523b63b1017b7e021d440a072.webm?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/798470/extras/2e87aac523b63b1017b7e021d440a072.mp4?t=1745422418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
